<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed Theme Editor export sometimes including extra content after a theme block — The static block range calculation now correctly handles trailing newlines, preventing stray characters from appearing in exported ThemePalette.swift.</li>
<li>Fixed MCP server logging reliability — Diagnostic log writes to stderr now use low-level C I/O instead of Foundation's FileHandle, preventing potential dropped or garbled log messages.</li>
</ul>
